  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 505.03); ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
